          "end": 6.54,
          "en": "with managing our application.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.54,
          "end": 7.86,
          "en": "Now there is so much you can do",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 7.86,
          "end": 9.66,
          "en": "but you hopefully got a good overview",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 9.66,
          "end": 13.41,
          "en": "of the different features and the ecosystem here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 13.41,
          "end": 14.31,
          "en": "Now when I come back",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 14.31,
          "end": 18.15,
          "en": "to one thing I mentioned earlier, multiple projects.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 18.15,
          "end": 22.35,
          "en": "Now I mentioned that inside Ava Angular project",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 22.35,
          "end": 26.16,
          "en": "or folder I should say, you can have multiple projects.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 26.16,
          "end": 27.84,
          "en": "Now you start with one project",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 27.84,
          "end": 29.46,
          "en": "but you can actually add a new one",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 29.46,
          "end": 32.43,
          "en": "with NG generate and then you can generate",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 32.43,
          "end": 34.17,
          "en": "one of two project types,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 34.17,
          "end": 35.46,
          "en": "a library",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 35.46,
          "end": 37.623,
          "en": "or an application.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 38.67,
          "end": 41.34,
          "en": "Now let's start with an application here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 41.34,
          "end": 43.71,
          "en": "If I type NG generate application,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 43.71,
          "end": 46.5,
          "en": "and I may be named as backend",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 46.5,
          "end": 48.69,
          "en": "because let's say I have my backend UI",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 48.69,
          "end": 53.07,
          "en": "for my administrators and a frontend UI for my end users.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 53.07,
          "end": 56.29,
          "en": "If I hit entry here, this will go ahead",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 57.18,
          "end": 58.83,
          "en": "and ask me the same questions",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 58.83,
          "end": 60.75,
          "en": "I got when I created this project",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 60.75,
          "end": 62.25,
          "en": "whether I want to add routing",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 62.25,
          "end": 65.19,
          "en": "and which style pre-processor I want to use.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 65.19,
          "end": 68.64,
          "en": "And now you see it adds a new projects folder here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 68.64,
          "end": 70.89,
          "en": "And in that projects folder",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 70.89,
          "end": 73.41,
          "en": "it has this sub folder named backend",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 73.41,
          "end": 75.12,
          "en": "which is the name I chose",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 75.12,
          "end": 79.74,
          "en": "which basically has a new Angular project in it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 79.74,
          "end": 81.96000000000001,
          "en": "A bit slimmer because they share",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 81.96000000000001,
          "end": 84.15,
          "en": "the same root Angular json file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 84.15,
          "end": 86.13,
          "en": "and package json file here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 86.13,
          "end": 90.21000000000001,
          "en": "but its own dedicated conflict files, its own source folder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 90.21000000000001,
          "end": 92.61,
          "en": "And in there, basically what we already know",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 92.61,
          "end": 95.72999999999999,
          "en": "this is a separate Angular application.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 95.72999999999999,
          "end": 97.32,
          "en": "Now we could serve this, which",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 97.32,
          "end": 102.27000000000001,
          "en": "with NG serve and then project equals backend.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 102.27000000000001,
          "end": 103.47,
          "en": "This is important of course",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 103.47,
          "end": 105.03,
          "en": "otherwise NG serve wouldn't know",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 105.03,
          "end": 106.97999999999999,
          "en": "that it should use this project.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 106.97999999999999,
          "end": 109.326,
          "en": "You can set the default project, Angular serve,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 109.326,
          "end": 111.75,
          "en": "or NG serve, or any other command",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 111.75,
          "end": 114.21000000000001,
          "en": "we'll use in the Angular json file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 114.21000000000001,
          "end": 115.614,
          "en": "There at the very bottom,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 115.614,
          "end": 118.35,
          "en": "you have this default project setting",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 118.35,
          "end": 119.46000000000001,
          "en": "which in my case is set",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 119.46000000000001,
          "end": 122.13,
          "en": "to my starting project Angular conflict.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 122.13,
          "end": 125.16,
          "en": "And if you set this, then NG serve or NG build",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 125.16,
          "end": 128.31,
          "en": "without any extra flag will always run against this project.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 128.31,
          "end": 130.65,
          "en": "Here, I ran it against backend.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 130.65,
          "end": 135.65,
          "en": "So unsurprisingly, if I visit local host 4,200",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 135.66,
          "end": 139.863,
          "en": "I now see this brand new project backend being served here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 140.91,
          "end": 144.27,
          "en": "Now, you could argue that this is a ugly project structure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 144.27,
          "end": 147.32999999999998,
          "en": "though having a projects folder as part",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 147.32999999999998,
          "end": 148.89,
          "en": "of our other main project.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 148.89,
          "end": 150.93,
          "en": "I'm not too happy with this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 150.93,
          "end": 153.21,
          "en": "Well, we can do better.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 153.21,
          "end": 156.15,
          "en": "Let's go back to the main terminal and to the folder where",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 156.15,
          "end": 158.16,
          "en": "we create our new Angular project.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 158.16,
          "end": 160.68,
          "en": "And now let's create a new one, NG new.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 160.68,
          "end": 164.46,
          "en": "And now let's say we're building a Angular shop,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 164.46,
          "end": 165.66,
          "en": "but it's totally up to you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 165.66,
          "end": 167.7,
          "en": "This is just a dummy name.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 167.7,
          "end": 171.63,
          "en": "Now you might remember that there is dash dash help",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 171.63,
          "end": 172.86,
          "en": "which you can use to run some commands",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 172.86,
          "end": 175.863,
          "en": "and there was a create dash application flag.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 177.69,
          "end": 181.203,
          "en": "And I will set this here to false.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 182.25,
          "end": 184.47,
          "en": "Now if we now run this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 184.47,
          "end": 186.51,
          "en": "something interesting will happen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 186.51,
          "end": 189.63,
          "en": "It now will generate some files,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 189.63,
          "end": 192.84,
          "en": "but actually less files than before.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 192.84,
          "end": 196.11,
          "en": "It will installs on dependencies, but it will not",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 196.11,
          "end": 200.1,
          "en": "create a brand new Angular application by default.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 200.1,
          "end": 201.87,
          "en": "Instead, let's wait for this to finish",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 201.87,
          "end": 203.61,
          "en": "and see what it gives us.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 203.61,
          "end": 205.53,
          "en": "Instead, once it finishes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 205.53,
          "end": 208.11,
          "en": "it gives us a folder that looks like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 208.11,
          "end": 209.76,
          "en": "So we have to config files, we know",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 209.76,
          "end": 212.07,
          "en": "but of course the app folder is missing.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 212.07,
          "end": 214.86,
          "en": "And now indeed here we can simply run",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 214.86,
          "end": 219.15,
          "en": "NG generate application, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 219.15,
          "end": 220.77,
          "en": "backend.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 220.77,
          "end": 223.65,
          "en": "And what it will do now is it will create",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 223.65,
          "end": 226.95,
          "en": "that new projects folder thereafter",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 226.95,
          "end": 228.69299999999998,
          "en": "and create it in there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 229.86,
          "end": 231.06,
          "en": "So you see here it is.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 231.06,
          "end": 233.57999999999998,
          "en": "So now we have the cleaner structure, which is nice",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 233.57999999999998,
          "end": 237.66,
          "en": "if you have multiple angular projects in one root folder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 237.66,
          "end": 240.08,
          "en": "Now every project will have its own sub folder",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 240.08,
          "end": 241.62,
          "en": "in the project folder",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 241.62,
          "end": 244.35,
          "en": "which I would argue is cleaner than what we had before.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 244.35,
          "end": 245.52,
          "en": "So in case you want to work",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
